      "section": "pixel-whale · 像素小鲸鱼",
      "text": "[English](#english) | [中文](#中文)\n\n<a id=\"中文\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "section": "中文",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness 侧边栏的**像素小鲸鱼桌宠**。打开面板就是一只手绘像素鲸鱼（13×8 精灵，canvas 逐像素渲染）在水族箱里生活：\n\n- 🐋 **自主巡游**：左右游动、上下浮动、随机换向，还会**眨眼**\n- 🫧 **吐泡泡**：气孔定时冒像素泡泡，摇摇晃晃升到水面\n- 🍤 **投食**：点击水面扔一粒食物，小鲸鱼会**游过去吃掉**，吃下冒像素爱心\n- 🤚 **摸摸**：点鲸鱼本体，它开心地摇摆 + 冒一串爱心\n- 纯前端、零网络、零配置，`requestAnimationFrame` 驱动，DPR 适配高分屏\n\n<a id=\"english\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "A **pixel-art whale pet** for the DeepSeek Harness sidebar. The panel is a small aquarium: a hand-drawn 13×8 pixel whale (rendered per-pixel on canvas) swims around, bobs, blinks, and blows pixel bubbles. **Click the water** to drop food — the whale swims over and eats it (pixel hearts!). **Click the whale** to pet it (wiggle + hearts). Pure client-side, zero network, zero config, DPR-aware."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install / 安装",
      "text": "- **Plugin Market**（收录后）: Plugins → Plugin Market, search `pixel whale`\n- **CLI**: `dsh plugin --profile <profile> add https://github.com/Wldeinsamkeit/pixel-whale`\n- **Manual**: clone and run `install_bundle` pointing at this directory"
    },
    {
